#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.md:1
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "贡献指南"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.md:4
msgid "Git Pull Request"
msgstr "提交 Pull Request"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.md:6
msgid "Please follow these steps to open a pull request:"
msgstr "请按以下步骤提交 Pull Request："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.md:8
msgid "Fork the repository"
msgstr "Fork 本仓库"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.md:9
msgid "Create your feature branch (`git checkout -b feature/AmazingFeature`)"
msgstr "创建功能分支（`git checkout -b feature/AmazingFeature`）"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.md:10
msgid "Commit your changes (`git commit -m 'Add some AmazingFeature'`)"
msgstr "提交改动（`git commit -m 'Add some AmazingFeature'`）"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.md:11
msgid "Push to the branch (`git push origin feature/AmazingFeature`)"
msgstr "推送分支（`git push origin feature/AmazingFeature`）"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.md:12
msgid "Open a Pull Request"
msgstr "创建 Pull Request"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.md:15
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "依赖要求"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.md:17
msgid ""
"Run the following commands from the repository root. First, install the required packages "
"specific for developers by running:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录执行以下命令，首先安装开发所需的依赖："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.md:25
msgid "Unit Tests"
msgstr "单元测试"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.md:27
msgid ""
"See the [testing guide](testing.md) for test organization, local commands, backend coverage, "
"architecture requirements, and test authoring conventions."
msgstr "测试目录、运行命令、backend 覆盖、架构要求和编写规范详见[测试指南](testing.md)。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.md:30
msgid "Code Style"
msgstr "代码风格"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.md:32
msgid ""
"We have some static checks when you commit your code change, please make sure you can pass all "
"the tests and make sure the coding style follows our requirements. We use pre-commit hooks to "
"make sure the code is aligned with the writing standard. To set up the code style checking, you "
"need to follow the steps below."
msgstr "提交改动时需要通过静态检查和相关测试。仓库使用 pre-commit hooks 维护统一代码风格，设置步骤如下。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.md:34
msgid "clang-format:"
msgstr "clang-format："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.md:41
msgid "pre-commit:"
msgstr "pre-commit："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.md:62
msgid "Code format checking will be automatically executed when you commit your changes."
msgstr "提交改动时会自动执行代码风格检查。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.md:66
msgid "Type Stubs (C++ Extension)"
msgstr "类型存根（C++ 扩展）"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.md:68
msgid ""
"If you modify the C++ extension (`magi_attn_ext`), please remember to regenerate the Python type "
"stubs (`.pyi` files). This ensures that static type checkers (like MyPy) and IDEs can correctly "
"recognize the updated C++ signatures."
msgstr "修改 C++ 扩展（`magi_attn_ext`）后，请重新生成 Python 类型存根（`.pyi`），确保 MyPy 等类型检查器和 IDE 正确识别新的 C++ 签名。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.md:70
msgid "Ensure the extension is installed in your environment, then run:"
msgstr "确认扩展已安装，然后执行："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.md:76
msgid "Failure to update stubs after modifying C++ code may cause type checking errors during CI."
msgstr "修改 C++ 代码后未更新类型存根，可能导致 CI 类型检查失败。"
